        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when you fuse a harpoon gun to a tow truck? Twin-stick car harpooning action! Harpoon and reel cars in, then tow them into the recycling crusher before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/715f32e24f93ea936a5ccfc408e9945c.poster.avif?t=1788912952\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/715f32e24f93ea936a5ccfc408e9945c.webm?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/715f32e24f93ea936a5ccfc408e9945c.mp4?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for 1-4 players locally or over Steam Remote Play, get the most points in a versus match to win - even if it means recycling your friends and harpooning through their ropes. Or fend off foes from your extra lives in &quot;Protect your Trucklings&quot; mode and be the last truck driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/278a58458baf216f65bea907e8cd63e3.poster.avif?t=1788912952\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/278a58458baf216f65bea907e8cd63e3.webm?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/278a58458baf216f65bea907e8cd63e3.mp4?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not feeling like beating up your buddies? Play together in co-op while towing off waves of potential parking perpetrators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/29de73db7779ef2b328925ed2f82c618.poster.avif?t=1788912952\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/29de73db7779ef2b328925ed2f82c618.webm?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/29de73db7779ef2b328925ed2f82c618.mp4?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features different environments and challenges to be aware of, from crumbling statues in Parkin’ Panic, to volcanic eruptions and homing lasers on tropical Volcarnage Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/c293a314f1cd294f21254fd7067a30e2.poster.avif?t=1788912952\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/c293a314f1cd294f21254fd7067a30e2.webm?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/c293a314f1cd294f21254fd7067a30e2.mp4?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play in versus mode against other players for points or stock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Feeling friendly? Take on waves of cars in co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ”Protect your Trucklings” mode in a last truck standing battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Surfing cars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple match customization settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Supports Steam Remote Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Googly eyes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/12d008876bef0fd8f91add3a05c94679.poster.avif?t=1788912952\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/12d008876bef0fd8f91add3a05c94679.webm?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/12d008876bef0fd8f91add3a05c94679.mp4?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
