ay together in co-op while towing off waves of potential parking perpetrators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/29de73db7779ef2b328925ed2f82c618.poster.avif?t=1788912952\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/29de73db7779ef2b328925ed2f82c618.webm?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/29de73db7779ef2b328925ed2f82c618.mp4?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features different environments and challenges to be aware of, from crumbling statues in Parkin’ Panic, to volcanic eruptions and homing lasers on tropical Volcarnage Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/c293a314f1cd294f21254fd7067a30e2.poster.avif?t=1788912952\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/c293a314f1cd294f21254fd7067a30e2.webm?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/c293a314f1cd294f21254fd7067a30e2.mp4?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play in versus mode against other players for points or stock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Feeling friendly? Take on waves of cars in co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ”Protect your Trucklings” mode in a last truck standing battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Surfing cars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple match customization settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Supports Steam Remote Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Googly eyes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/12d008876bef0fd8f91add3a05c94679.poster.avif?t=1788912952\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/12d008876bef0fd8f91add3a05c94679.webm?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068840/extras/12d008876bef0fd8f91add3a05c94679.mp4?t=1788912952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
